DESCRIPTION:This year’s Master Gardener Annual Plant Sale is more exciting with a 40% overall\nincrease in plant selection.\n\n \n\nWe will have a 60% increase in perennial varieties\, and offer more straight species\nnatives\, and more selection of plants for the shade garden.\n\nCome shop our expanded plant sale!\n\n \n\nThe sale will be held at Presby Memorial Iris Garden\, 474 Upper Mountain Avenue\, Montclair at the following dates and times:\n\n \n\n 	Friday\, May 1st from 10am to 4pm\n \n 	Saturday\, May 2nd from 9am to 3pm\n\nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
