SUMMARY:Meet the Artists at Astra Jewelers
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of art\, texture\, and creative energy\, with the opportunity to meet the talented artists behind the work on our walls and experience their pieces in person! \nFeatured artists:\nChristy Hyonsuk\nArmando “OUTthere” Diaz\nJen Martin\nErin Roll\nSaturday\, May 2nd 4-7pm \nLocated on the second floor of 250 Bellevue Avenue in Upper Montclair \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
